# LF everywhere, whatever the laptop. The sources are authored on Windows and the hooks
# and the workflow run on Linux, and a carriage return in a shell script is a failure that
# names nothing: the shell reports the error against the line, not against the ending.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Named again for the files where it matters most, so the intent survives anyone
# relaxing the rule above.
*.sh text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Binary formats, never diffed or merged as text. No PDF or PNG is published here; the
# rules are kept so that one arriving by accident is not mangled on its way to being
# refused by the guards.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
